2026-07-27T09:04:58.8851896Z i /tmp/Rtmpx4oouI/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:04:58.8852183Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:04:58.8852512Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:04:58.8853140Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:04:58.8853607Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:04:58.8854275Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:04:58.8854781Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
